{
  "bookId": "hero-212014",
  "id": "bond-29327",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29327001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "早上好，主人~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好巧啊，真乃也是来这购物的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不，我是在晨跑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "虽然已经是手办了，但也不能松懈每天的锻炼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "很好的习惯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "说起来，你晨跑的里程可真长啊……都从家附近跑到别的街区了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……诶，我们现在不是在爱猫社区吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这里是潮酷街区。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊，果然……我又跑错路线了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "一出门就容易绕远路，还好这次碰到了主人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "大概是因为还不熟悉周边的地区吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "跑步的时候容易放空心思……然后不知不觉就跑到别的地方去了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还认得回家的路吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "唔……没有什么自信。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我们一起晨跑吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "跟着我跑就不会迷路了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "好，谢谢主人~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "于是，两人开始朝着家的方向奔跑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29327019",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "等下，她跑得好快！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
